WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.260
This world of ours...

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.090
...is filled with a menagerie of life.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:16.140
Birds, beasts,

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.590
botanical beings.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:21.340
Fish, insects,

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:24.090
faeries and spirits.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.550
And yes...

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:30.680
...even humans.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.930
But the being that reigns
above them all...

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.550
...is the mighty dragon.

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:43.680
Its wings can take hold of the wind;

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:47.760
its claws can slice through
even the toughest materials.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:52.680
Its fire could raze the world to ash.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:58.140
A legendary beast
truly worthy of its throne.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.640
However...

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:08.510
Very rarely, one encounters a dragon...

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:09.430
You imbecile!

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:10.680
I'm sorry!

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.930
...that is none of those things.

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:50.390
Most living beings possess a home
that is well-suited to their needs.

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:53.590
Some live upon the surface.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:56.510
Some live in deep waters.

00:02:56.510 --> 00:03:00.930
Some even make their home in fiery depths.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:03.180
All beings understand the importance

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.070
Open House

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.070
Come on in! - Elf Housing Realty

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:08.220
of possessing a home
they can call their own.

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:14.340
Boy, this place is great! Nice and dark,
the right amount of humidity.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:19.760
And this cave dwelling was built
just 93 years ago! It's so new!

