00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.800
The mana feels right, too.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.550
And it has three baths!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.300
We won't have to go far to wash up!

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:31.390
It says here it's got a system
to prevent overflow on rainy days!

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.930
The hallways are a bit narrow,

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.590
but I suppose that doesn't
matter much to us slimes.

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:38.470
Oh, wow!

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.800
Look at all this storage space!

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:44.340
We'll have more than enough
room for our mana stones!

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.260
Check this out!

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.180
We can use these nooks as beds!

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:52.680
Nobody will step on us
when we're fast asleep in here!

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:55.930
Honey, the whole reason we're moving
is to <i>avoid</i> other beings.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:57.340
Oh, right.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:00.010
This place is so charming.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:03.680
And with all these rooms,
we'll have plenty of space for kids.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.300
Oh, honey...

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:08.050
Thank you for touring
the property today.

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.510
Oh, no, thank <i>you</i> for the tour!

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:13.220
What are your thoughts?

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:16.470
You were right on the money.
This is the perfect place for us.

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.430
I'm happy to hear that.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.720
If you purchase this property today,

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:25.550
you'll find that the previous owner's
camouflage spell is still under contract,

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:29.640
and it will keep the entrance to your
new home hidden for two more years.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:30.470
What?!

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:33.220
Oh, honey, we <i>have</i> to buy this place!

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:35.050
You're absolutely right. We're sold!

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:36.590
Thank you very much.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:40.590
I'm so glad we were able to find
something on such short notice.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:46.430
You see, our last home was highlighted
in a popular Hero magazine,

